# agent-pack — the main of agent-pack's own development

POLICY language:
    ABOUT    the language of everything written in this project
    APPLIES  universal

    ALWAYS  write code, comments, .ap files, documentation and commit messages in English

POLICY commits:
    ABOUT    the authorization and the content of every git commit in this project
    APPLIES  universal

    NEVER  create a commit, a branch or a tag without the developer's explicit authorization
    NEVER  credit any AI harness or tool in a commit or a pull request — Claude, Claude Code or other — not even in a Co-Authored-By line

POLICY security:
    ABOUT    baseline security rules every agent in this project respects
    APPLIES  universal

    ALWAYS  validate every input crossing a trust boundary
    ALWAYS  treat secrets as opaque tokens — never log them, never echo them
    ALWAYS  fail closed when a permission check is ambiguous
    NEVER   commit credentials, .env files or private keys

POLICY raw-access:
    ABOUT    who may access raw/
    APPLIES  universal

    NEVER  access raw/, unless you are the wiki-curator agent

MAIN:
    ABOUT   always-on rules for agent-pack core development
    VERSION 0.1.0
    TEAMS   feature-delivery
    MEMBER  wiki-curator
